@startuml
title Tropilot — Overall Use-Case Diagram
top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 25
skinparam titleFontSize 32
skinparam actorFontSize 24
skinparam usecaseFontSize 24
skinparam rectangleFontSize 26
skinparam ArrowFontSize 18
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor #3F4D63
}

actor Administrator as Admin
actor Staff
actor "Head Resident" as Resident

rectangle "Tropilot Rental Property Operations Management System" {
  usecase "Administration\nManage users, buildings, rooms,\nresident contracts and finance" as UC_Admin #FFF3D6

  usecase "Building Operations\nManage utilities, service fees, equipment, invoices,\npayments, tasks, maintenance and SMTP notifications" as UC_Staff #F2F9E9

  usecase "Resident Self-Service and SePay Payment\nView room, contract and invoices; pay by QR or submit proof;\nmanage members, vehicles, maintenance and feedback" as UC_Resident #F7EEFF

  usecase "Common Access and Gemini AI Support\nAuthenticate, manage profile, view notifications\nand ask a role-scoped AI assistant" as UC_Common #EAF2FF
}

' One short association per human role keeps the overall scope readable.
Admin -right- UC_Admin
Staff -right- UC_Staff
Resident -right- UC_Resident

note bottom of UC_Common
Shared by Administrator,
Staff and Head Resident.
end note

note right of UC_Staff
External integrations:
Gemini API · SePay QR/webhook · SMTP Email Service
end note

' Fixed 2 × 2 layout for Word-sized output.
UC_Admin -[hidden]right-> UC_Staff
UC_Resident -[hidden]right-> UC_Common
UC_Admin -[hidden]down-> UC_Resident
UC_Staff -[hidden]down-> UC_Common
@enduml
